      "message": "Okay so in the light of the comments above you do need this constructor, but musn\u0027t this always be nri.mNetworkRequestForCallback ?\nIIUC this creates a new NRI to replace an old one and will take its place. If that\u0027s the case, the argument is both unnecessary and confusing.",
